rations \u00e0 l'insu de l'occupant, malgr\u00e9 les risques encourus.", "inscription:fr:4": "Cette mission permit ensuite la localisation et la restitution de plus de 45 000 \u0153uvres d'art.", "inscription:fr:5": "La pr\u00e9sente plaque a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9voil\u00e9e le 27 avril 2005 par Renaud Donnedieu de Vabres, ministre de la culture et de la communication, en hommage \u00e0 cet acte de courage et de r\u00e9sistance.", "memorial": "plaque", "name": "Rose Valland", "start_date": "2005-04-27", "subject:wikidata": "Q222961", "subject:wikipedia": "fr:Rose Valland", "wikimedia_commons": "File:Plaque Rose Valland.jpg"}}, {"type": "node", "id": 5310383588, "lat": 48.8646885, "lon": 2.3264742}, {"type": "node", "id": 5310383589, "lat": 48.8646751, "lon": 2.3264631}, {"type": "node", "id": 5310383590, "lat": 48.8646646, "lon": 2.3264462}, {"type": "node", "id": 5310383591, "lat": 48.8647282, "lon": 2.326343}, {"type": "node", "id": 5310383592, "lat": 48.8647405, "lon": 2.3263586}, {"type": "node", "id": 5310383593, "lat": 48.8647488, "lon": 2.3263796}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769152, "lat": 48.8631088, "lon": 2.3272815}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769153, "lat": 48.8631119, "lon": 2.3272993}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769154, "lat": 48.8631193, "lon": 2.327314}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769155, "lat": 48.8631313, "lon": 2.327324}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769156, "lat": 48.8631458, "lon": 2.3273251}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769157, "lat": 48.8631111, "lon": 2.3272602}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769158, "lat": 48.8631676, "lon": 2.3273012}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769159, "lat": 48.8631678, "lon": 2.3273003}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769160, "lat": 48.863792, "lon": 2.327754}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769161, "lat": 48.8637952, "lon": 2.3277465}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769162, "lat": 48.8637984, "lon": 2.3277305}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769163, "lat": 48.8638003, "lon": 2.3277096}, {"type": "node", "id": 5530769164, "lat": 48.8637984, "l